  "scope": "One additive host operating policy with exact2027\u20132041rows. Separate external-packaging policy retained. No equity or discounting calculation, no frozen file edits.",
  "chronology": "Prior base, funded-bull and packaging values were already known. These paired inputs were sent to root before annual operating calculation. No equity output for the new pair was viewed or calculated during selection; the capital choice is independent of the shipment downgrade.",
  "preferred_operating_judgment": "Use this moderated CPU/reuse host plus the already-frozen external-packaging companion for the next prospective evaluation. It keeps strong recovery but recognizes lost accepted shipments, weaker absorption and sticky near-term investment. It is not a stock recommendation before its full funding/claim valuation.",
