    "2028_2030_rationale": "Retain25/18/12% growth as an owned delayed-ramp path: more qualified tools and substrates become useful after the2027 constraint, then growth decelerates. This preserves, rather than recovers, the lost2027 level. It requires continuing demand and does not mechanically assume Intel recovers market share.",
    "revenue_level": "With the same2026base, ASPs and subsequent growth, server units and revenue remain12/13 of the funded-bull path in every future year. No deferred2027 invoice or extra catch-up sale is inserted. Client and OtherDCAI/OtherCCPG paths remain unchanged; no ARM market loss is automatically reassigned to Intel custom silicon.",
