    "DCAI_margin_rationale": "Reduce product margin by0.5percentage point relative to the funded bull for lower design/sales/support expense absorption at lower revenue. Manufacturing transfer-price and wafer/process-cost improvements remain in Foundry; this is not a second manufacturing-loss charge.",
