    "capex_rationale": "Retain2027\u201328 tool/site spending because lead times, the existing program and supplier needs make immediate resizing unrealistic; not every dollar is asserted legally noncancelable. Reduce2029\u201330 additions by1B/year as later prospective capacity can be moderated for a lower revenue level. Ongoing nodes, renewal and substantial net expansion remain funded.",
