    "DA_rationale": "Retain the normalized expense/addback of the committed plant base rather than making lower production immediately reduce depreciation. The modest later spending cuts concern future growth capacity; unchanged near-term D&A is a conservative aggregate normalization, not an exact asset-commissioning ledger.",
    "WC_rule": "Retain the host supplier/prepayment envelope. Change annual WC cash use by minus10% of the annual change in the host sales shortfall. This reduces trade balances in proportion to lower sales while preserving most early supplier funding. Starting shortfall is zero in2026.",
